         <div type="edition">
            <ab xml:lang="Egyd-Egydmd egy-demp">
               <pb n="R" />
               <lb n="x+1" /> tw=y ı͗r nꜣ sm(ꜣꜥ) (n) <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#p10010">Ns-H̱nm-mtr</persName>
               <lb n="x+2" />
               <rs ref="ancient_titles.xml#idt212" type="title">pꜣ ḥm-nṯr tpy</rs> n.m-bꜣḥ <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#d3">Wsı͗r</persName>
               <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#d5">Ḥr</persName>
               <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#d6">ꜣs.t</persName>
               <lb n="x+3" />
               <rs ref="ancient_titles.xml#idt287" type="title">nꜣ nṯr.w <damage degree="high">ꜣbḏw</damage></rs> ı͗w=w (r) ḏı͗.t <lb n="x+4" /> qy=k ẖn nꜣ ḥsy.w <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#d12">H̱nm</persName>
               <lb n="x+5" />
               <rs ref="ancient_titles.xml#idt38" type="title">pꜣ nṯr ꜥꜣ</rs> hb n=y <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#p1540">Pa-rt sꜣ <surname>Pa-Ḥr</surname></persName>
               <lb n="x+6" /> (r-)dbꜣ ḥḏ qd.t 4 <damage degree="high">5/6</damage> ḏd ḏd s <lb n="x+7" />
               <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#p1535">Pa-rt sꜣ <surname>Ir.t-ḥr-r.r=w</surname></persName> ḏd ḏı͗=y s (n) <lb n="x+8" />
               <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#p1545">Pa-rt sꜣ <surname>Ns-qy-<damage degree="high">šw.ty</damage>
                  </surname></persName>(n) rn=k <lb n="x+9" /> mn ḥḏ ı͗.ḏı͗ s n=y <lb n="x+10" />
               <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#p1535">Pa-rt sꜣ <surname>Ir.t-ḥr-r.r=w</surname></persName> (n) rn <lb n="x+11" />
               <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#p1540">Pa-rt sꜣ <surname>Pa-Ḥr</surname></persName> mn <lb n="x+12" /> ḥḏ ı͗w tw=f s ꜥn sp-2 <lb n="x+13" />
               <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#d3">Wsı͗r</persName>
               <rs ref="ancient_titles.xml#idt38" type="title">pꜣ nṯr ꜥꜣ</rs> r ḏı͗.t ꜥḥꜥ=y <lb n="x+14" /> ı͗.ı͗r-ḥr <rs ref="ancient_titles.xml#idt212" type="title">pꜣ ḥm-nṯr tpy</rs> ı͗w mn ḏꜣ <lb n="x+15" /> sẖ n <date notAfter="-223-06-16" notBefore="-223-06-16" when-custom="Ptolemaios_III:24">ḥsb.t 24 tpy šmw sw 6</date>
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:lang=" en">
               <pb n="" />
               <lb n="x+1" /> I perform the blessings of Eschnompmetis, <lb n="x+2" /> the high priest, before Osiris, Horus, Isis (and) <lb n="x+3" /> the gods of Abydos NOTE. They may grant <lb n="x+4" /> that you are exalted among the praised ones of Chnoum, <lb n="x+5" /> the great god. Thus has sent to me Parates (A) NOTE, son of Payris <lb n="x+6" /> concerning the 4 5/6 silver kite: ‘Thus has spoken <lb n="x+7" /> Parates (B), son of Inaros: I have given them (scil. the money) to <lb n="x+8" /> Parates (C), son of Eskasothes, (in) your name. <lb n="x+9" /> There is no money which <lb n="x+10" /> Parates (B), son of Inaros, would have given to me (in) the name <lb n="x+11" /> of Parates (A), son of Payris. There is no <lb n="x+12" /> money which he would have given (to me), precisely nothing! <lb n="x+13" /> Osiris, the great god, may cause me to stand <lb n="x+14" /> before the high priest without blemish. <lb n="x+15" /> Written in the 24th regnal year, 6th of Pachons. </ab>
         </div>
